{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "指标口径",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 调用阶段\n- `total`：平台一次调用总耗时（不含 HTTP 读写、鉴权等最外层开销）。\n- `platform`：`total - dapr_call`，平台侧纯开销。\n- `gate`：实例检查 + 发布闸门（DB/缓存）。\n- `meta`：算法元数据读取（带缓存）。\n- `session`：有状态算法的会话解析（DB）。\n- `dapr_call`：平台 → Dapr sidecar → 算法 → 返回。\n- `algorithm`：Dapr → 本地计时代理 → 算法应用，表示算法自身执行耗时（含本地 HTTP 转发开销）。\n- `postprocess`：会话注入、算法元数据回填。\n\n**Dapr 开销 ≈ dapr_call - algorithm**。下方三张图按算法/方法展示平台、算法、Dapr 的平均耗时。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP QPS（按接口模板）",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (method, route) (rate(awesome_http_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP P95 耗时（按接口模板）",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route) (rate(awesome_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "HTTP 5xx 比例",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "decimals": 2, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 } ] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(awesome_http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[1m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(awesome_http_requests_total[1m])), 1e-9)"
        }
      ]
    },
